msgid "Thai"
msgstr "Tajlandski"

msgid "Thailanda"
msgstr "Tajland"

msgid ""
"Thank you for using the wizard. Your box is now ready to use.\n"
"Please press OK to start using your receiver."
msgstr ""
"Hvala na korištenju čarobnjaka. Prijamnik je spreman.\n"
"Pritisni OK za početak."

msgid ""
"The NetworkWizard extension is not installed!\n"
"Please install it."
msgstr ""
"Dodatak NetworkWizard nije instaliran!\n"
"Instaliraj ga."

msgid "The PIN code has been changed successfully."
msgstr "PIN kod je uspješno promijenjen."

msgid "The PIN codes you entered are different."
msgstr "Uneseni PIN kodovi se razlikuju."

msgid ""
"The Softwaremanagement extension is not installed!\n"
"Please install it."
msgstr ""
"Dodatak Softwaremanagement nije instaliran!\n"
"Instaliraj ga."

msgid "The WiFi adapter could not be started."
msgstr "WiFi adapter se ne može pokrenuti."

msgid "The WiFi screen could not be opened."
msgstr "WiFi zaslon se ne može otvoriti."

msgid "The WiFi settings could not be saved."
msgstr "WiFi postavke se ne mogu spremiti."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The directory %s is not writable.\n"
"Make sure you select a writable directory instead."
msgstr ""
"Direktorij %s nije zapisiv.\n"
"Odaberi zapisivi direktorij."

msgid "The following files were found..."
msgstr "Pronađene su sljedeće datoteke..."

msgid "The installation of the default services lists is finished."
msgstr "Instalacija zadanih popisa usluga je završena."

msgid ""
"The installation of the default settings is finished. You can now continue "
"configuring your receiver by pressing the OK button on the remote control."
msgstr ""
"Instalacija zadanih postavki je završena. Sada možeš nastaviti konfigurirati "
"svoj prijamnik pritiskom na tipku OK na daljinskom upravljaču."

msgid ""
"The name cannot contain / or \\, cannot start with a dot and must fit in 255 "
"characters."
msgstr ""
"Naziv ne smije sadržavati / ni \\, ne smije počinjati točkom i mora stati u "
"255 znakova."

msgid "The network settings could not be saved."
msgstr "Mrežne postavke se ne mogu spremiti."

msgid ""
"The new mode is used when a channel starts. Keep it?\n"
"Without an answer the previous setting comes back."
msgstr ""
"Novi način rada primjenjuje se pri pokretanju kanala. Zadržati ga?\n"
"Bez odgovora vraća se prethodna postavka."

msgid "The new video setting was not confirmed. The previous setting is back."
msgstr "Nova video postavka nije potvrđena. Vraćena je prethodna postavka."

msgid "The package doesn't contain anything."
msgstr "Paket ne sadrži ništa."

msgid "The password may have at most 63 characters"
msgstr "Lozinka može imati najviše 63 znaka"

msgid "The password may only contain letters, digits and the usual signs"
msgstr "Lozinka može sadržavati samo slova, brojke i uobičajene znakove"

msgid "The password must have at least 8 characters"
msgstr "Lozinka mora imati najmanje 8 znakova"

#, python-format
msgid "The path %s already exists."
msgstr "Putanja %s već postoji."

msgid "The pin code you entered is wrong."
msgstr "Uneseni PIN kod je pogrešan."

msgid "The playlist is empty"
msgstr "Popis reprodukcije je prazan"

msgid "The previous settings are back."
msgstr "Prethodne postavke su vraćene."

msgid "The previous settings could not be written back completely."
msgstr "Prethodne postavke nisu mogle biti u potpunosti vraćene."

msgid ""
"The receiver did not accept the new video mode. The previous setting is back."
msgstr ""
"Prijamnik nije prihvatio novi video način. Prethodna postavka je vraćena."

#, python-format
msgid "The results have been written to %s."
msgstr "Rezultati su zapisani u %s."

msgid "The skin has errors, the receiver keeps working:\n"
msgstr "Skin ima greške, prijamnik nastavlja raditi:\\n\n"

msgid "The sleep timer has been activated."
msgstr "Tajmer za isključivanje je aktiviran."

msgid "The sleep timer has been disabled."
msgstr "Tajmer za isključivanje je deaktiviran."

msgid "The timer file (timers.xml) is corrupt and could not be loaded."
msgstr "Datoteka tajmera (timers.xml) je oštećena i ne može se učitati."

msgid "The transponders had a signal, but did not send any channels."
msgstr "Transponderi su imali signal, ali nisu poslali nijedan kanal."

msgid ""
"The transponders had a signal, but no free channels (the scan was for free "
"channels only)."
msgstr ""
"Transponderi su imali signal, ali nema slobodnih kanala (pretraživanje je "
"bilo samo za slobodne kanale)."

msgid ""
"The tuner could not be used. It may be busy with a recording or not "
"configured."
msgstr ""
"Tuner se nije mogao koristiti. Možda je zauzet snimanjem ili nije "
"konfiguriran."

msgid ""
"The wireless LAN plugin is not installed!\n"
"Please install it."
msgstr ""
"Plugin za bežični LAN nije instaliran!\n"
"Instaliraj ga."

msgid "There are no default services lists in your image."
msgstr "U tvojoj slici nema zadanih popisa usluga."

msgid "There are no default settings in your image."
msgstr "U tvojoj slici nema zadanih postavki."

msgid "There are no folders here"
msgstr "Ovdje nema mapa"

msgid ""
"There might not be enough Space on the selected Partition.\n"
"Do you really want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Možda nema dovoljno prostora na particiji.\n"
"Želiš li nastaviti?"

msgid "There were no transponders to scan."
msgstr "Nije bilo transpondera za pretraživanje."

msgid "This folder cannot be read"
msgstr "Ova mapa ne može se pročitati"

msgid "This folder is empty"
msgstr "Ova je mapa prazna"

msgid "This is step number 2."
msgstr "Ovo je korak broj 2."

msgid "This kind of network security is not supported"
msgstr "Ova vrsta mrežne sigurnosti nije podržana"

